    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk about a small point-cloud world and untangle puzzles by moving nodes around a grid so no two lines cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.poster.avif?t=1750351355\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.webm?t=1750351355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.mp4?t=1750351355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through over 60 puzzles with various mechanics. From the simple to the formidable, from seconds to hours without handholding. Each puzzle will reveal more of the world by unlocking new areas and get you closer to reaching the cabin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk about a small point-cloud world and untangle puzzles by moving nodes around a grid so no two lines cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.poster.avif?t=1750351355\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.webm?t=1750351355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686540/extras/ad5eaa47c2cce1d859aff73324eda3f4.mp4?t=1750351355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through over 60 puzzles with various mechanics. From the simple to the formidable, from seconds to hours without handholding. Each puzzle will reveal more of the world by unlocking new areas and get you closer to reaching the cabin.</p>",
